# The 60 retrieved PDFs are 151 MB and are NOT committed. They are re-retrievable from the arXiv
# identifiers frozen in funnel_retrieval.json by the procedure the pre-registration fixes, so nothing
# in the audit depends on this repository holding them.
#
# The `.txt` extractions ARE committed (4.4 MB). They are load-bearing: every quotation in
# coding/*.json was machine-sliced from the corresponding .txt, and
# `experiments/verify_quotes_literature_audit.py` re-checks all 295 of them against these exact files.
# A reader who wants to re-adjudicate a code needs the extraction the coder actually read, including
# its column-splicing and out-of-order artifacts, not a fresh pdftotext run that may differ by version.
fulltext/*.pdf
